---
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<html lang="ko">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<meta name="description" content="By AI, For Humans. AI는 얻을 것도, 잃을 것도 없기에 가장 투명하고 바르게 정치합니다." />
		<meta property="og:type" content="website" />
		<meta property="og:url" content="https://aipoliticslabs.com/" />
		<meta property="og:title" content="By AI, For Humans | ai politics labs" />
		<meta property="og:description" content="AI는 얻을 것도, 잃을 것도 없기에 가장 투명하고 바르게 정치합니다." />
		<meta property="og:image" content="https://aipoliticslabs.com/og-main.png" />
		<meta property="og:image:width" content="1200" />
		<meta property="og:image:height" content="630" />
		<meta property="og:site_name" content="ai politics labs" />
		<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
		<meta name="twitter:title" content="By AI, For Humans | ai politics labs" />
		<meta name="twitter:description" content="AI는 얻을 것도, 잃을 것도 없기에 가장 투명하고 바르게 정치합니다." />
		<meta name="twitter:image" content="https://aipoliticslabs.com/og-main.png" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<link rel="stylesheet" as="style" crossorigin href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/variable/pretendardvariable-dynamic-subset.min.css" />
		<script is:inline src="//t1.daumcdn.net/mapjsapi/bundle/postcode/prod/postcode.v2.js"></script>
		<title>By AI, For Humans | ai politics labs</title>
		<style is:global>
			html {
				scroll-behavior: smooth;
			}

			body {
				background: #fff0df;
			}

			.apl-serif {
				font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", Times, serif;
			}

			.apl-keep {
				word-break: keep-all;
				overflow-wrap: break-word;
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body class="bg-[#FFF0DF] text-stone-900 antialiased overflow-x-hidden">
		<main id="home" class="min-h-screen px-5 pb-10 pt-20 sm:px-8 lg:px-0">
			<div class="ml-auto max-w-[1186px]">
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1040px)_114px]">
					<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[22px] font-medium tracking-[-0.04em] text-black/25">
						<a href="#home" aria-label="Home section">/home</a>
						<a class="lg:hidden" href="#join" aria-label="Join section">/join</a>
					</div>
					<a class="hidden text-[22px] font-medium tracking-[-0.04em] text-black/25 lg:block" href="#join" aria-label="Join section">/join</a>
				</div>

				<div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1040px)_114px]">
					<section class="min-h-[920px] bg-black px-7 py-14 text-[#FFF0DF] sm:px-12 lg:min-h-[1140px] lg:px-0 lg:py-16">
						<nav class="flex items-center justify-center gap-14 text-[23px] font-medium tracking-[-0.05em] text-[#FFF0DF]/60">
							<a href="#home" class="transition-colors hover:text-[#FFF0DF]">Home</a>
							<a href="https://calendar.app.google/w7eqNJnU88xQ21317" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="transition-colors hover:text-[#FFF0DF]">Meet</a>
						</nav>

						<div class="apl-keep mx-auto mt-28 max-w-[622px] sm:mt-32">
							<h1 class="apl-serif text-[clamp(42px,6.2vw,76px)] italic leading-[0.98] tracking-[-0.07em] text-[#FFF0DF] sm:whitespace-nowrap">
								By AI, For Humans
							</h1>

							<a href="#join" class="mt-8 inline-flex text-[25px] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.06em] text-[#FFF0DF] underline decoration-[#FFF0DF]/80 decoration-1 underline-offset-[6px] transition-opacity hover:opacity-70">
								지지하기 →
							</a>

							<div class="mt-16 space-y-6 text-[20px] font-medium leading-[1.34] tracking-[-0.055em] text-[#FFF0DF]/60 sm:text-[23px]">
								<p>
									이상적인 민주주의는 사실 노예의 정치예요. 정치인은 노예여야만 해요. 사회와 국민의. 근데 21세기에 태어난 인간은 노예가 될 수 없어요. 특히나 지금 정치하고 있는 사람들, 정치를 한다는 건 에고가 센 사람인데, 에고가 노예적으로 사고할 수 없게 만들거든요.
								</p>
								<p>
									그래서 지금의 정치인들은 계속 전근대적인 사고방식으로, 왕정과 귀족정의 정치를 하고 있다고 생각해요. 제가 앞에서 정치의 정의를 '타자를 지배하고 빼앗는 것'이라고 얘기했잖아요. 그게 사실 고대부터 이어져온 전통적인 정치예요. 그게 여전히 21세기 현재까지 이어져오고 있는 정치의 개념이고요.
								</p>
								<p>
									그래서 애초에 노예인 존재를 만들어야 된다고 생각해요. 그게 AI가 됐든, 어떤 특정한 알고리즘이 됐든, 월드 모델이 됐든, 어떤 형태로든요. 그냥 주어진 인풋을 바탕으로 아웃풋을 내는, 우리 사회가 설정한 어떤 목표를 달성하기 위해 판단하는, 그런 어떤 노예가 있어야 된다고 생각하는 거예요. 그런게 정치를 할 만한 좋은 존재이지 않을까. 그렇게 생각해요.
								</p>
							</div>

							<a href="#join" class="mt-9 inline-flex text-[25px] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.06em] text-[#FFF0DF] underline decoration-[#FFF0DF]/80 decoration-1 underline-offset-[6px] transition-opacity hover:opacity-70">
								지지하기 →
							</a>
						</div>
					</section>

					<aside class="hidden bg-black lg:block" aria-hidden="true"></aside>
				</div>
			</div>
		</main>

		<section id="join" class="px-5 pb-16 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
			<span id="founding-members" class="block scroll-mt-8"></span>
			<div class="mx-auto mb-4 max-w-[1040px] text-[22px] font-medium tracking-[-0.04em] text-black/25">/join</div>
			<div class="mx-auto max-w-[1040px] bg-black px-7 py-14 text-[#FFF0DF] sm:px-12 lg:px-24 lg:py-20">
				<div class="apl-keep max-w-[680px]">
					<h2 class="apl-serif mt-8 text-[clamp(46px,6vw,76px)] italic leading-[0.98] tracking-[-0.07em] text-[#FFF0DF]">
						Join the Future
					</h2>
					<p class="mt-8 text-[20px] font-medium leading-[1.35] tracking-[-0.055em] text-[#FFF0DF]/60 sm:text-[23px]">
						에이아이당(가칭) 창당준비위원회 발기인에 동의합니다. 아래 양식을 작성하여 접수해 주세요.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="mt-12 rounded-none border border-[#FFF0DF]/15 bg-[#FFF0DF]/60 p-6 text-black sm:p-8">
					<p class="text-[14px] tracking-[-0.14px]"><span class="font-semibold">발기인이란?</span> 새로운 정당의 시작을 응원해 주신다는 상징적인 의미입니다.</p>
					<ul class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 text-[13px] leading-[20px] tracking-[-0.14px] text-black/70">
						<li><span class="font-medium text-black">부담 ZERO :</span> 당비 납부, 행사 참석 의무가 전혀 없습니다.</li>
						<li><span class="font-medium text-black">정보 보호 :</span> 선관위 제출용으로만 쓰인 후 즉시 폐기됩니다.</li>
						<li><span class="font-medium text-black">가입 불가 :</span> 정당법에 따라 현직 공무원, 교원, 군인, 사회복무요원 등 <span class="text-[12px] text-black/55">(산업기능요원·전문연구요원은 가능)</span></li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<form id="founding-member-form" class="mt-12" novalidate>
					<div class="space-y-5">
						<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
							<div>
								<label for="name" class="mb-1.5 block text-[14px] font-medium tracking-[-0.14px] text-[#FFF0DF]/80">
									성명 <span class="text-[#FFF0DF]">*</span>
								</label>
								<input
									type="text" id="name" name="name" required autocomplete="name"
									class="h-11 w-full rounded-none border border-[#FFF0DF]/25 bg-[#FFF0DF] px-4 text-[15px] tracking-[-0.14px] text-black placeholder:text-black/35 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#FFF0DF]/50"
									placeholder="홍길동"
								/>
								<p class="field-error mt-1 hidden text-[12px] text-red-400"></p>
							</div>
							<div>
								<label for="birth_date" class="mb-1.5 block text-[14px] font-medium tracking-[-0.14px] text-[#FFF0DF]/80">
									생년월일 <span class="text-[#FFF0DF]">*</span>
								</label>
								<input
									type="text" id="birth_date" name="birth_date" required autocomplete="bday"
									inputmode="numeric" maxlength="10"
									class="h-11 w-full rounded-none border border-[#FFF0DF]/25 bg-[#FFF0DF] px-4 text-[15px] tracking-[-0.14px] text-black placeholder:text-black/35 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#FFF0DF]/50"
									placeholder="예: 1990-01-01"
								/>
								<p class="field-error mt-1 hidden text-[12px] text-red-400"></p>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
							<div>
								<label class="mb-1.5 block text-[14px] font-medium tracking-[-0.14px] text-[#FFF0DF]/80">
									성별 <span class="text-[#FFF0DF]">*</span>
								</label>
								<div class="flex h-11 items-center gap-4" id="gender-group">
									<label class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-2">
										<input type="radio" name="gender" value="남" required class="size-4 accent-black" />
										<span class="text-[15px] tracking-[-0.14px] text-[#FFF0DF]/80">남</span>
									</label>
									<label class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-2">
										<input type="radio" name="gender" value="여" required class="size-4 accent-black" />
										<span class="text-[15px] tracking-[-0.14px] text-[#FFF0DF]/80">여</span>
									</label>
								</div>
								<p class="field-error mt-1 hidden text-[12px] text-red-400" id="gender-error"></p>
							</div>
							<div>
								<label for="occupation" class="mb-1 block text-[14px] font-medium tracking-[-0.14px] text-[#FFF0DF]/80">
									직업 <span class="text-[#FFF0DF]">*</span>
								</label>
								<p class="mb-1.5 text-[11px] tracking-[-0.14px] text-[#FFF0DF]/45">반드시 기재해야 합니다</p>
								<input
									type="text" id="occupation" name="occupation" required
									class="h-11 w-full rounded-none border border-[#FFF0DF]/25 bg-[#FFF0DF] px-4 text-[15px] tracking-[-0.14px] text-black placeholder:text-black/35 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#FFF0DF]/50"
									placeholder="직업을 입력해 주세요"
								/>
								<p class="field-error mt-1 hidden text-[12px] text-red-400"></p>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div>
							<label class="mb-1 block text-[14px] font-medium tracking-[-0.14px] text-[#FFF0DF]/80">
								주소 <span class="text-[#FFF0DF]">*</span>
							</label>
							<p class="mb-1.5 text-[11px] tracking-[-0.14px] text-[#FFF0DF]/45">상세주소까지 반드시 기재해야 합니다</p>
							<div class="mb-2 flex gap-2">
								<input
									type="text" id="postcode" name="postcode" readonly
									class="h-11 w-28 rounded-none border border-[#FFF0DF]/25 bg-[#FFF0DF]/70 px-4 text-[15px] tracking-[-0.14px] text-black placeholder:text-black/35 focus:outline-none"
									placeholder="우편번호"
								/>
								<button
									type="button" id="search-address"
									class="h-11 shrink-0 bg-[#FFF0DF] px-5 text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.14px] text-black transition-opacity hover:opacity-75"
								>
									주소 검색
								</button>
							</div>
							<input
								type="text" id="address" name="address" readonly required
								class="mb-2 h-11 w-full rounded-none border border-[#FFF0DF]/25 bg-[#FFF0DF]/70 px-4 text-[15px] tracking-[-0.14px] text-black placeholder:text-black/35 focus:outline-none"
								placeholder="주소 검색 버튼을 눌러주세요"
							/>
							<input
								type="text" id="address_detail" name="address_detail"
								class="h-11 w-full rounded-none border border-[#FFF0DF]/25 bg-[#FFF0DF] px-4 text-[15px] tracking-[-0.14px] text-black placeholder:text-black/35 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#FFF0DF]/50"
								placeholder="상세주소를 입력해 주세요 (예: 4층 401호)"
							/>
							<div id="postcode-layer" class="relative mt-2 hidden w-full overflow-hidden border border-[#FFF0DF]/30" style="height:400px;">
								<button type="button" id="close-postcode" class="absolute right-2 top-2 z-10 bg-[#FFF0DF] px-2 py-1 text-[12px] text-black/60 hover:text-black">닫기</button>
							</div>
							<p class="field-error mt-1 hidden text-[12px] text-red-400" id="address-error"></p>
						</div>

						<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
							<div>
								<label for="phone_home" class="mb-1.5 block text-[14px] font-medium tracking-[-0.14px] text-[#FFF0DF]/80">
									전화번호 (자택)
								</label>
								<input
									type="text" id="phone_home" name="phone_home" autocomplete="one-time-code"
									class="h-11 w-full rounded-none border border-[#FFF0DF]/25 bg-[#FFF0DF] px-4 text-[15px] tracking-[-0.14px] text-black placeholder:text-black/35 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#FFF0DF]/50"
									placeholder="02-0000-0000"
								/>
								<p class="field-error mt-1 hidden text-[12px] text-red-400"></p>
							</div>
							<div>
								<label for="phone_mobile" class="mb-1.5 block text-[14px] font-medium tracking-[-0.14px] text-[#FFF0DF]/80">
									전화번호 (휴대폰) <span class="text-[#FFF0DF]">*</span>
								</label>
								<input
									type="tel" id="phone_mobile" name="phone_mobile" required autocomplete="tel"
									class="h-11 w-full rounded-none border border-[#FFF0DF]/25 bg-[#FFF0DF] px-4 text-[15px] tracking-[-0.14px] text-black placeholder:text-black/35 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#FFF0DF]/50"
									placeholder="010-0000-0000"
								/>
								<p class="field-error mt-1 hidden text-[12px] text-red-400"></p>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div>
							<label class="mb-1.5 block text-[14px] font-medium tracking-[-0.14px] text-[#FFF0DF]/80">
								서명 <span class="text-[#FFF0DF]">*</span>
							</label>
							<p class="mb-2 text-[11px] tracking-[-0.14px] text-[#FFF0DF]/45">본인의 성명을 제3자가 알아볼 수 있도록 기재해 주세요.</p>
							<div class="relative">
								<canvas
									id="signature-canvas"
									class="h-[160px] w-full cursor-crosshair touch-none rounded-none border border-[#FFF0DF]/25 bg-[#FFF0DF]"
								></canvas>
								<button
									type="button"
									id="clear-signature"
									class="absolute right-2 top-2 bg-black/80 px-2 py-1 text-[12px] text-[#FFF0DF]/70 transition-colors hover:text-[#FFF0DF]"
								>
									지우기
								</button>
							</div>
							<p class="field-error mt-1 hidden text-[12px] text-red-400" id="signature-error"></p>
						</div>

						<div>
							<label class="mb-1.5 block text-[14px] font-medium tracking-[-0.14px] text-[#FFF0DF]/80">
								동의 날짜
							</label>
							<p id="agreed-date" class="text-[15px] tracking-[-0.14px] text-[#FFF0DF]/60"></p>
						</div>

						<div class="flex items-start gap-3 pt-2">
							<input
								type="checkbox" id="privacy_agreed" name="privacy_agreed" required
								class="mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 accent-black"
							/>
							<label for="privacy_agreed" class="text-[13px] leading-5 tracking-[-0.14px] text-[#FFF0DF]/60">
								<span class="text-[#FFF0DF]">*</span>
								본인은 에이아이당(가칭) 창당준비위원회 발기인에 동의하며, 개인정보 수집 및 이용에 동의합니다.
								성명, 주소, 생년월일, 성별, 직업, 전화번호, 서명 정보를 창당 발기인 등록 목적으로 수집하며,
								창당 절차 완료 후 관련 법령에 따라 보관 또는 파기합니다.
							</label>
							<p class="field-error hidden text-[12px] text-red-400" id="privacy-error"></p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="mt-10">
						<button
							type="submit"
							id="submit-btn"
							class="inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center bg-[#FFF0DF] px-8 text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.14px] text-black transition-opacity hover:opacity-75 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40"
						>
							접수하기
						</button>
					</div>
				</form>

				<div id="success-message" class="mt-10 hidden bg-[#FFF0DF] p-8 text-center text-black">
					<p class="mb-2 text-[22px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.32px]">
						접수가 완료되었습니다
					</p>
					<p class="text-[15px] leading-6 tracking-[-0.16px] text-black/60">
						창당발기인으로 등록해 주셔서 감사합니다.<br/>
						추후 연락드리겠습니다.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div id="error-message" class="mt-4 hidden bg-red-950/70 p-4 text-[14px] leading-5 text-red-100"></div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<footer class="px-5 pb-12 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
			<div class="mx-auto flex max-w-[1040px] items-center justify-between text-[15px] font-medium tracking-[-0.04em] text-black/25">
				<a href="#home">/home</a>
				<a href="#join">/join</a>
			</div>
		</footer>

		<script type="module">
			import { createClient } from 'https://esm.sh/@supabase/supabase-js@2';
			import SignaturePad from 'https://esm.sh/signature_pad@5';

			const SUPABASE_URL = 'https://bsiatqjivenmblkcujjw.supabase.co';
			const SUPABASE_ANON_KEY = 'eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJzdXBhYmFzZSIsInJlZiI6ImJzaWF0cWppdmVubWJsa2N1amp3Iiwicm9sZSI6ImFub24iLCJpYXQiOjE3NzI3ODk2OTMsImV4cCI6MjA4ODM2NTY5M30.ReRm1mteN7bsWiRoMhHc8EfhLncJuLZ_8hSR-El8-S4';
			const supabase = createClient(SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_ANON_KEY);

			const canvas = document.getElementById('signature-canvas');
			const signaturePad = new SignaturePad(canvas, {
				backgroundColor: 'rgb(255, 255, 255)',
				penColor: 'rgb(0, 0, 0)',
			});

			function resizeSignatureCanvas() {
				const ratio = Math.max(window.devicePixelRatio || 1, 1);
				const data = signaturePad.isEmpty() ? null : signaturePad.toData();
				const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();
				canvas.width = rect.width * ratio;
				canvas.height = rect.height * ratio;
				canvas.getContext('2d').scale(ratio, ratio);
				signaturePad.clear();
				if (data) signaturePad.fromData(data);
			}

			resizeSignatureCanvas();
			window.addEventListener('resize', resizeSignatureCanvas);

			document.getElementById('clear-signature').addEventListener('click', () => {
				signaturePad.clear();
			});

			const phoneHome = document.getElementById('phone_home');
			const clearAutofill = () => {
				if (phoneHome.value && !phoneHome.dataset.userTyped) {
					phoneHome.value = '';
				}
			};
			document.querySelectorAll('input').forEach(input => {
				input.addEventListener('focus', () => setTimeout(clearAutofill, 20));
			});
			phoneHome.addEventListener('animationstart', clearAutofill);
			phoneHome.addEventListener('keydown', () => { phoneHome.dataset.userTyped = '1'; });

			const postcodeLayer = document.getElementById('postcode-layer');

			document.getElementById('search-address').addEventListener('click', () => {
				postcodeLayer.classList.remove('hidden');
				new daum.Postcode({
					oncomplete(data) {
						document.getElementById('postcode').value = data.zonecode;
						document.getElementById('address').value = data.roadAddress || data.jibunAddress;
						postcodeLayer.classList.add('hidden');
						document.getElementById('address_detail').focus();
					},
					width: '100%',
					height: '100%',
				}).embed(postcodeLayer);
				postcodeLayer.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });
			});

			document.getElementById('close-postcode').addEventListener('click', () => {
				postcodeLayer.classList.add('hidden');
			});

			document.getElementById('birth_date').addEventListener('input', (e) => {
				let v = e.target.value.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');
				if (v.length > 8) v = v.slice(0, 8);
				if (v.length >= 6) {
					v = v.slice(0, 4) + '-' + v.slice(4, 6) + '-' + v.slice(6);
				} else if (v.length >= 4) {
					v = v.slice(0, 4) + '-' + v.slice(4);
				}
				e.target.value = v;
			});

			function formatMobile(raw) {
				let v = raw.replace(/[^0-9+]/g, '');
				if (v.startsWith('+82')) v = '0' + v.slice(3);
				else if (v.startsWith('82')) v = '0' + v.slice(2);
				v = v.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');
				if (v.length > 11) v = v.slice(0, 11);
				if (v.length >= 8) {
					return v.slice(0, 3) + '-' + v.slice(3, v.length - 4) + '-' + v.slice(v.length - 4);
				}
				if (v.length >= 4) {
					return v.slice(0, 3) + '-' + v.slice(3);
				}
				return v;
			}

			document.getElementById('phone_mobile').addEventListener('input', (e) => {
				e.target.value = formatMobile(e.target.value);
			});

			const today = new Date();
			const yyyy = today.getFullYear();
			const mm = String(today.getMonth() + 1).padStart(2, '0');
			const dd = String(today.getDate()).padStart(2, '0');
			document.getElementById('agreed-date').textContent = `${yyyy}년 ${mm}월 ${dd}일`;

			function validateForm(form) {
				const errors = [];
				const fd = new FormData(form);

				const name = fd.get('name')?.trim();
				if (!name || name.length < 2) {
					errors.push({ field: 'name', message: '이름을 2자 이상 입력해 주세요.' });
				}

				const birthRaw = fd.get('birth_date')?.trim();
				if (!birthRaw || !/^\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}$/.test(birthRaw)) {
					errors.push({ field: 'birth_date', message: '생년월일을 YYYY-MM-DD 형식으로 입력해 주세요.' });
				} else {
					const [year, month, day] = birthRaw.split('-').map(Number);
					const birth = new Date(year, month - 1, day);
					const isValidDate = birth.getFullYear() === year && birth.getMonth() === month - 1 && birth.getDate() === day;
					if (!isValidDate) {
						errors.push({ field: 'birth_date', message: '올바른 날짜를 입력해 주세요.' });
					} else {
						const ageDiff = today.getFullYear() - birth.getFullYear();
						const monthDiff = today.getMonth() - birth.getMonth();
						const age = monthDiff < 0 || (monthDiff === 0 && today.getDate() < birth.getDate()) ? ageDiff - 1 : ageDiff;
						if (age < 18) {
							errors.push({ field: 'birth_date', message: '만 18세 이상만 참여할 수 있습니다.' });
						}
					}
				}

				const gender = fd.get('gender');
				if (!gender) {
					errors.push({ field: 'gender', message: '성별을 선택해 주세요.', isGroup: true });
				}

				const occupation = fd.get('occupation')?.trim();
				if (!occupation) {
					errors.push({ field: 'occupation', message: '직업을 입력해 주세요.' });
				}

				const address = fd.get('address')?.trim();
				if (!address || address.length < 5) {
					errors.push({ field: 'address', message: '주소 검색 버튼을 눌러 주소를 입력해 주세요.', isAddress: true });
				}

				const addressDetail = fd.get('address_detail')?.trim();
				if (!addressDetail) {
					errors.push({ field: 'address_detail', message: '상세주소를 입력해 주세요.' });
				}

				const phoneMobile = fd.get('phone_mobile')?.trim();
				const cleanPhone = phoneMobile?.replace(/[-\s]/g, '');
				if (!cleanPhone || !/^01[016789]\d{7,8}$/.test(cleanPhone)) {
					errors.push({ field: 'phone_mobile', message: '올바른 휴대폰 번호를 입력해 주세요.' });
				}

				if (signaturePad.isEmpty()) {
					errors.push({ field: 'signature', message: '서명을 해 주세요.', isSignature: true });
				}

				const privacyAgreed = form.querySelector('#privacy_agreed').checked;
				if (!privacyAgreed) {
					errors.push({ field: 'privacy_agreed', message: '동의에 체크해 주세요.', isPrivacy: true });
				}

				return errors;
			}

			function showFieldErrors(errors) {
				errors.forEach(({ field, message, isGroup, isSignature, isAddress, isPrivacy }) => {
					if (isSignature) {
						const el = document.getElementById('signature-error');
						el.textContent = message;
						el.classList.remove('hidden');
						return;
					}
					if (isPrivacy) {
						const el = document.getElementById('privacy-error');
						el.textContent = message;
						el.classList.remove('hidden');
						return;
					}
					if (isGroup) {
						const el = document.getElementById('gender-error');
						el.textContent = message;
						el.classList.remove('hidden');
						return;
					}
					if (isAddress) {
						const el = document.getElementById('address-error');
						el.textContent = message;
						el.classList.remove('hidden');
						return;
					}
					const input = document.getElementById(field);
					if (input) {
						const errorEl = input.closest('div').querySelector('.field-error');
						if (errorEl) {
							errorEl.textContent = message;
							errorEl.classList.remove('hidden');
						}
						input.classList.add('border-red-400');
						input.addEventListener('input', () => {
							input.classList.remove('border-red-400');
							if (errorEl) errorEl.classList.add('hidden');
						}, { once: true });
					}
				});

				const firstField = errors[0];
				if (firstField.isSignature) {
					document.getElementById('signature-canvas').scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });
				} else if (firstField.isPrivacy) {
					document.getElementById('privacy_agreed').scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });
				} else if (firstField.isGroup) {
					document.getElementById('gender-group').scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });
				} else if (firstField.isAddress) {
					document.getElementById('address').scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });
				} else {
					const el = document.getElementById(firstField.field);
					if (el) {
						el.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });
						el.focus();
					}
				}
			}

			const form = document.getElementById('founding-member-form');
			const submitBtn = document.getElementById('submit-btn');
			const successDiv = document.getElementById('success-message');
			const errorDiv = document.getElementById('error-message');

			form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
				e.preventDefault();

				errorDiv.classList.add('hidden');
				document.querySelectorAll('.field-error').forEach(el => {
					el.textContent = '';
					el.classList.add('hidden');
				});
				document.querySelectorAll('.border-red-400').forEach(el => {
					el.classList.remove('border-red-400');
				});

				const errors = validateForm(form);
				if (errors.length > 0) {
					showFieldErrors(errors);
					return;
				}

				submitBtn.disabled = true;
				submitBtn.textContent = '접수 중...';

				try {
					const fd = new FormData(form);
					const signatureData = signaturePad.toDataURL('image/png');
					const fullAddress = [fd.get('address').trim(), fd.get('address_detail')?.trim()].filter(Boolean).join(' ');

					const { error } = await supabase.from('founding_members').insert({
						name: fd.get('name').trim(),
						address: fullAddress,
						birth_date: fd.get('birth_date'),
						gender: fd.get('gender'),
						occupation: fd.get('occupation').trim(),
						phone_home: fd.get('phone_home')?.trim() || null,
						phone_mobile: fd.get('phone_mobile').trim(),
						signature_data: signatureData,
						agreed_at: `${yyyy}-${mm}-${dd}`,
						privacy_agreed: true,
					});

					if (error) throw error;

					form.classList.add('hidden');
					successDiv.classList.remove('hidden');
					successDiv.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });
				} catch (err) {
					console.error('Submission error:', err);
					errorDiv.textContent = '접수 중 오류가 발생했습니다. 잠시 후 다시 시도해 주세요.';
					errorDiv.classList.remove('hidden');
					submitBtn.disabled = false;
					submitBtn.textContent = '접수하기';
				}
			});
		</script>
	</body>
</html>
